#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_CLASSES_BIRD_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "animal class Birds description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "DayOnePatch"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_CLASSES_BIRD_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Humans were born too late to hunt dinosaurs. But at least you can hunt their"
" direct, feather-bearing descendants! Birds by definition have bird brains, "
"but they make up for it with a formidable combination of being easy to spook"
" and (usually) quick to flee."
msgstr ""
"Lidé se na světě objevili příliš pozdě na lov dinosaurů. Můžete však lovit "
"jejich přímé, opeřené potomky! Ptáci mají zkrátka ptačí mozečky, ale "
"vynahrazují to tím, že se snadno vyplaší a obvykle rychle prchají."

