#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_FAMILIES_ANTILOCAPRID_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal family Antilocaprids
#. description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "DayOnePatch"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_FAMILIES_ANTILOCAPRID_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"The definition of being different for the sake of being different, this "
"unique family of ungulates endemic to North America has a single species "
"living today—the pronghorn. To dial up the uniqueness quotient, their "
"closest relative is not the antelope or the deer, but the giraffe!"
msgstr ""
"Jako by se tato jedinečná čeleď severoamerických kopytníků chtěla lišit za "
"každou cenu. Dnes ji zastupuje jediný žijící druh – vidloroh. A jako by to "
"nestačilo, jeho nejbližším příbuzným není antilopa ani jelen, ale žirafa!"

