#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_FAMILIES_BEAR_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "animal family Bears description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "DayOnePatch"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_FAMILIES_BEAR_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Don't be fooled by their stocky legs and awkward gait. Bears are proficient "
"climbers, runners, and swimmers; they will hunt you down anywhere when they "
"feel threatened. Just thank God you'll usually only encounter one paw-bearer"
" at a time."
msgstr ""
"Nenechte se zmást jejich mohutnýma nohama a těžkopádnou chůzí. Medvědi "
"výborně šplhají, běhají i plavou. Pokud se cítí ohroženi, budou vás "
"pronásledovat kamkoli. Naštěstí obvykle narazíte jen na jednoho medvěda "
"najednou."

