#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_FAMILIES_HIPPOPOTAMID_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal family Hippopotamids
#. description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "DayOnePatch"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_FAMILIES_HIPPOPOTAMID_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Pigs can't fly, but there are large pig-like creatures that can swim very "
"well—we call them hippos. They aren't actually that closely related to pigs,"
" and are actually more closely related to whales. Characterized by nearly "
"hairless skin, stumpy legs, and barrel-shaped bodies, hippopotamids can hold"
" their own on dry land as well."
msgstr ""
"Prasata neumějí létat, ale existují velká zvířata podobná prasatům, která "
"skvěle plavou – hroši. S prasaty však nejsou příliš blízce příbuzní; blíže "
"mají k velrybám. Vyznačují se téměř holou kůží, krátkýma silnýma nohama a "
"soudkovitým tělem a dobře si poradí i na souši."

