#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_FAMILIES_LEPORID_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "animal family Leporids description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "DayOnePatch"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_FAMILIES_LEPORID_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Cute little critters with elongated ears and legs. Don't be fooled by the "
"famous Monty Python movie, they aren't actually that dangerous, and spend "
"most of their lives under the constant threat of being hunted down by "
"carnivores."
msgstr ""
"Roztomilá zvířátka s dlouhýma ušima a nohama. Nenechte se zmást slavným "
"filmem Monty Python: ve skutečnosti nejsou nijak zvlášť nebezpečná. Většinu "
"života naopak čelí hrozbě, že je uloví nějaký predátor."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_FAMILIES_LEPORID_NAME
