#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_FAMILIES_PHASIANID_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "animal family Phasianids description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "DayOnePatch"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_FAMILIES_PHASIANID_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"This family of landfowls includes some of the most popular gamebirds, such "
"as turkeys, partridges, and of course pheasants themselves. These are some "
"of the most ornate creatures on the planet, with males often boasting "
"brightly-colored plumage."
msgstr ""
"Tato čeleď hrabavých zahrnuje oblíbenou pernatou zvěř, například krocany, "
"koroptve a samozřejmě bažanty. Patří mezi nejnápadněji zdobené tvory na "
"světě; samci se často pyšní pestrým opeřením."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_FAMILIES_PHASIANID_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "animal family Phasianids name"
