#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_FAMILIES_STRUTHIONID_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal family Struthionids
#. description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "DayOnePatch"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_FAMILIES_STRUTHIONID_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"This family includes all living ostriches. Most of them inhabit Africa, but "
"some are also native to Asia. One thing that they all have in common, "
"though, is that they don't fly."
msgstr ""
"Do této čeledi patří všichni žijící pštrosi. Většina obývá Afriku, někteří "
"mají původ také v Asii. Jedno však mají společné: nelétají."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_FAMILIES_STRUTHIONID_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "animal family Struthionids name"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "DayOnePatch"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_FAMILIES_STRUTHIONID_NAME"
msgid "Struthionids"
msgstr "Pštrosovití"

