#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_FAMILIES_SWINE_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "animal family Swines description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "DayOnePatch"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_FAMILIES_SWINE_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Defined by their cylindrical snouts and high-pitched squeals, all swine are "
"native to Europe, Asia, and Africa. However, they are currently present in "
"all the other continents as well, except Antarctica, often as unwanted, "
"invasive species."
msgstr ""
"Prasatovití mají typický válcovitý rypák a pronikavě kvičí. Původem jsou z "
"Evropy, Asie a Afriky. Dnes však žijí i na ostatních kontinentech kromě "
"Antarktidy, často jako nežádoucí invazní druhy."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_FAMILIES_SWINE_NAME
