#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_ORDERS_CARNIVORAN_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "animal order Carnivorans description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "DayOnePatch"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_ORDERS_CARNIVORAN_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Carnivores have an exclusively meat-based diet, with animal tissue meeting "
"all their needs for nutrition and energy. These flesh-eaters, especially the"
" larger ones, often find themselves on the top of food chains."
msgstr ""
"Masožravci se živí výhradně masem, které jim poskytuje potřebné živiny i "
"energii. Zejména ti větší často stojí na vrcholu potravního řetězce."

