#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BEARBROWN_APPEARANCE_AGE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Brown bear age
#. variation description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BEARBROWN_APPEARANCE_AGE"
msgid "Older animals have more prominent muscle mass around the shoulders."
msgstr "Starší zvířata mají výraznější svalovou hmotu kolem ramen."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BEARBROWN_APPEARANCE_COAT
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Brown bear coat
#. description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BEARBROWN_APPEARANCE_COAT"
msgid "Brown with lighter or grizzled tips"
msgstr "Hnědá srst se světlejšími nebo prošedivělými konečky chlupů"

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BEARBROWN_APPEARANCE_DIMENSIONS
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Brown bear sex
#. dimensions description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BEARBROWN_APPEARANCE_DIMENSIONS"
msgid ""
"Males are more robust and about a third larger and heavier than females. "
"Specifically, male legs are noticeably longer. Females have larger ears "
"though."
msgstr ""
"Samci jsou mohutnější, asi o třetinu větší a těžší než samice. Mají také "
"výrazně delší končetiny, zatímco samice mají větší uši."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BEARBROWN_APPEARANCE_SEX
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Brown bear sex other
#. parameters description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BEARBROWN_APPEARANCE_SEX"
msgid ""
"Males eat more food and have on average a higher percentage of meat in their"
" diet."
msgstr ""
"Samci přijímají více potravy a v jejich jídelníčku bývá vyšší podíl masa."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BEARBROWN_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Brown bear
#. description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BEARBROWN_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"One of the largest carnivorans, with only the polar bear exceeding it in "
"size. However, they turn vegetarian during seasons when a meat-based diet "
"becomes unsustainable."
msgstr ""
"Medvěd hnědý patří k největším suchozemským šelmám; větší bývá jen medvěd "
"lední. V obdobích, kdy nemá dostatek masité potravy, se živí převážně "
"rostlinami."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BEARBROWN_HUNTING_BIOMES
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Brown bear biomes
#. description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BEARBROWN_HUNTING_BIOMES"
msgid "Alpine meadows, coastlines, mountain woodlands with dense cover nearby"
msgstr "Horské louky, pobřeží a horské lesy s hustým krytem v okolí"

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BEARBROWN_HUNTING_STRENGTHS01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Brown bear strength
#. against hunters 01"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BEARBROWN_HUNTING_STRENGTHS01"
msgid "Quickly covers ground when threatened"
msgstr "Při ohrožení rychle překonává velké vzdálenosti"

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BEARBROWN_HUNTING_STRENGTHS02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Brown bear strength
#. against hunters 02"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BEARBROWN_HUNTING_STRENGTHS02"
msgid "Aggressive when cornered"
msgstr "Při zahnání do úzkých může zaútočit"

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BEARBROWN_HUNTING_WEAKNESSES01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Brown bear weakness
#. against hunters 01"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BEARBROWN_HUNTING_WEAKNESSES01"
msgid "Large size makes them stand out"
msgstr "Mohutné tělo je snadno vidět"

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BEARBROWN_HUNTING_WEAKNESSES02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Brown bear weakness
#. against hunters 02"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BEARBROWN_HUNTING_WEAKNESSES02"
msgid "Predictable feeding patterns such as salmon runs"
msgstr "Předvídatelné hledání potravy, například během tahu lososů"

