#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BEARBROWN_TRIVIA01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Brown bear trivia
#. fact 01"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BEARBROWN_TRIVIA01"
msgid ""
"As Brown bears enter a dormant state, their heartbeat drops to 10 beats per "
"minute."
msgstr ""
"Během zimního klidu může medvědovi hnědému klesnout tepová frekvence až na "
"deset úderů za minutu."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BEARBROWN_TRIVIA02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Brown bear trivia
#. fact 02"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BEARBROWN_TRIVIA02"
msgid ""
"Brown bears are highly intelligent, thanks to their relatively large brains."
" They use tools in their daily life, for both hunting and playing, and have "
"excellent memories."
msgstr ""
"Medvědi hnědí jsou velmi inteligentní díky poměrně velkému mozku. Při lovu i"
" při hře používají různé předměty jako nástroje a mají výbornou paměť."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BEARBROWN_TRIVIA03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Brown bear trivia
#. fact 03"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BEARBROWN_TRIVIA03"
msgid ""
"Brown bears are able to smell cubs, mates, other predators and food from "
"many miles away."
msgstr ""
"Medvědi hnědí dokážou na velkou vzdálenost vycítit mláďata, potenciální "
"partnery, jiné predátory i potravu."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BEARBROWN_TRIVIA04
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Brown bear trivia
#. fact 04"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BEARBROWN_TRIVIA04"
msgid ""
"Thanks to their excellent eyesight, Brown bears can identify ripe fruit from"
" an impressive distance."
msgstr ""
"Medvěd hnědý má výborný zrak a dokáže na velkou vzdálenost rozeznat zralé "
"ovoce."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BISONAMERICAN_APPEARANCE_AGE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species American bison age
#. variation name"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BISONAMERICAN_APPEARANCE_AGE"
msgid "Adults develop a pronounced hump along with larger horns."
msgstr "Dospělí jedinci mají výrazný hrb a větší rohy."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BISONAMERICAN_APPEARANCE_COAT
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species American bison coat
#. description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BISONAMERICAN_APPEARANCE_COAT"
msgid "Dark brown to black, lighter on the hindquarters"
msgstr "Tmavě hnědá až černá srst, na zádi světlejší"

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BISONAMERICAN_APPEARANCE_DIMENSIONS
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species American bison sex
#. dimensions description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BISONAMERICAN_APPEARANCE_DIMENSIONS"
msgid ""
"Bulls are a third to a half larger than cows. Bulls sport more massive "
"horns, blockier heads, thicker necks, larger humps."
msgstr ""
"Býci jsou o třetinu až polovinu větší než krávy. Mají mohutnější rohy, "
"hranatější hlavu, silnější krk a větší hrb."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BISONAMERICAN_APPEARANCE_SEX
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species American bison sex
#. other parameters description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BISONAMERICAN_APPEARANCE_SEX"
msgid "Bull horns curve outward, cow horns curve inward."
msgstr "Rohy býků se stáčejí ven, rohy krav dovnitř."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BISONAMERICAN_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species American bison
#. description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BISONAMERICAN_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"One of the largest bovines native to North America, they nearly went extinct"
" in the 19th century. Thanks to conservation efforts forcing people to come "
"to their senses in time, bison are now spread over smaller populations in "
"Canada, the United States, and Mexico."
msgstr ""
"Bizon americký patří k největším severoamerickým turovitým. V 19. století "
"téměř vyhynul. Díky ochraně dnes znovu žije v menších populacích v Kanadě, "
"Spojených státech a Mexiku."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BISONAMERICAN_HUNTING_BIOMES
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species American bison
#. biomes description"
