#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BISONAMERICAN_TRIVIA01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species American bison
#. trivia fact 01"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BISONAMERICAN_TRIVIA01"
msgid ""
"The Bison has a hunch on its back. The hunch is composed of muscles, and it "
"helps the Bison to make its way through the snowpack."
msgstr "Bizonův svalnatý hrb mu pomáhá prorážet cestu hlubokým sněhem."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BISONAMERICAN_TRIVIA02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species American bison
#. trivia fact 02"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BISONAMERICAN_TRIVIA02"
msgid "Bison like wallowing, rolling and rubbing against the ground."
msgstr "Bizoni se rádi válejí v prachu a otírají se o zem."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BISONAMERICAN_TRIVIA03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species American bison
#. trivia fact 03"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BISONAMERICAN_TRIVIA03"
msgid ""
"Bison are seen in winter with unmelted snow on their backs, due to their "
"thick coats isolating their warm skin from the outer surface."
msgstr ""
"V zimě může bizonům zůstávat na hřbetě neroztátý sníh. Jejich hustá srst "
"dobře izoluje tělesné teplo."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BISONAMERICAN_TRIVIA04
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species American bison
#. trivia fact 04"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BISONAMERICAN_TRIVIA04"
msgid ""
"By the early 20th century, Wood bison were regarded as extremely rare, "
"devastated by unregulated hunting and loss of habitats."
msgstr ""
"Na počátku 20. století byl bizon lesní mimořádně vzácný v důsledku "
"neregulovaného lovu a úbytku prostředí, v němž žije."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BISONAMERICAN_TRIVIA05
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species American bison
#. trivia fact 05"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BISONAMERICAN_TRIVIA05"
msgid ""
"Bison are excellent jumpers, able to jump up to 6 ft (1.82 m) off the "
"ground. Along with jumping, they are also excellent at running and swimming."
msgstr ""
"Bizoni výborně skáčou: dokážou vyskočit až 1,82 metru vysoko. Jsou také "
"dobří běžci a plavci."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BOAR_APPEARANCE_AGE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "animal species Boar age description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BOAR_APPEARANCE_AGE"
msgid "Initially have striped coats that fade with age."
msgstr "Selata mají pruhovanou srst, jejíž kresba s věkem mizí."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BOAR_APPEARANCE_COAT
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "animal species Boar coat description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BOAR_APPEARANCE_COAT"
msgid "Gray to dark-brown"
msgstr "Šedá až tmavě hnědá"

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BOAR_APPEARANCE_DIMENSIONS
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Boar sex dimensions
#. description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BOAR_APPEARANCE_DIMENSIONS"
msgid ""
"Males have larger bodies and tusks, with additional tusks on the upper lip. "
"They are also more muscular."
msgstr ""
"Kňouři jsou větší a svalnatější. Mají mohutnější dolní kly (páráky) i horní "
"kly (klektáky)."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BOAR_APPEARANCE_SEX
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Boar sex other
#. parameters description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BOAR_APPEARANCE_SEX"
msgid "Males are more solitary."
msgstr "Kňouři žijí častěji samotářsky."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BOAR_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "animal species Boar description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BOAR_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"One of the widest-ranging mammals in the world. Native to Europe, Asia, and "
"North Africa, considered invasive in the Americas, Australia and New "
"Zealand, wild boars can be found everywhere they can get their snouts. "
"Recently re-hybridized with feral pigs."
msgstr ""
"Prase divoké patří k nejrozšířenějším savcům světa. Pochází z Evropy, Asie a"
" severní Afriky; v Americe, Austrálii a na Novém Zélandu je považováno za "
"invazní druh. Přizpůsobí se téměř všude a kříží se i se zdivočelými domácími"
" prasaty."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BOAR_HUNTING_BIOMES
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Boar biomes
#. description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BOAR_HUNTING_BIOMES"
msgid ""
"Grasslands, shrublands, woodlands, swamps, requiring lots of water sources "
"and dense cover"
msgstr ""
"Travnaté pláně, křoviny, lesy a bažiny s dostatkem vody a hustým krytem"

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BOAR_HUNTING_STRENGTHS01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Boar strength
#. against hunters 01"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BOAR_HUNTING_STRENGTHS01"
msgid "Tough skin and strong muscles"
msgstr "Pevná kůže a silné svaly"

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BOAR_HUNTING_WEAKNESSES01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Boar weakness
#. against hunters 01"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BOAR_HUNTING_WEAKNESSES01"
msgid "Predictable life cycle exposable to ambushes"
msgstr "Pravidelný denní režim usnadňuje čekanou"

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BOAR_NAME
