msgstr "Sus scrofa"

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BOAR_TRIVIA01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "animal species Boar trivia fact 01"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BOAR_TRIVIA01"
msgid ""
"Wild boars use their elongated and elastic snouts when digging out roots and"
" bulbs."
msgstr ""
"Prase divoké ryje protáhlým, ohebným rypákem v zemi a vyhrabává kořeny a "
"cibule rostlin."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BOAR_TRIVIA02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "animal species Boar trivia fact 02"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BOAR_TRIVIA02"
msgid ""
"Male Wild boars possess additional tusks on the upper lip, which they use to"
" sharpen the tusks on the lower lip."
msgstr ""
"Kňourům rostou v horní čelisti klektáky, o které se ostří dolní kly zvané "
"páráky."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BOAR_TRIVIA03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "animal species Boar trivia fact 03"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BOAR_TRIVIA03"
msgid ""
"In the past, hairs from the neck of the Wild boar were used to make "
"toothbrushes."
msgstr ""
"V minulosti se štětiny z šíje prasete divokého používaly k výrobě zubních "
"kartáčků."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BONTEBOK_APPEARANCE_AGE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Bontebok age
#. variation description"
