#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BONTEBOK_TRIVIA01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Bontebok trivia fact
#. 01"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BONTEBOK_TRIVIA01"
msgid ""
"Bontebok were once extensively hunted for their meat, skin and as pests, and"
" were reduced to a wild population of just 17 animals."
msgstr ""
"Buvolci pestří byli dříve intenzivně loveni pro maso a kůže i jako údajní "
"škůdci. Ve volné přírodě jich nakonec zůstalo pouhých 17."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BUFFALOAFRICAN_APPEARANCE_AGE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
