msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BUFFALOAFRICAN_APPEARANCE_COAT"
msgid "Reddish-brown to black"
msgstr "Červenohnědý až černý"

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BUFFALOAFRICAN_APPEARANCE_DIMENSIONS
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species African buffalo sex
#. dimensions description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BUFFALOAFRICAN_APPEARANCE_DIMENSIONS"
msgid "Males are larger and about a fourth heavier."
msgstr "Samci jsou větší a asi o čtvrtinu těžší."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BUFFALOAFRICAN_APPEARANCE_SEX
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species African buffalo sex
#. other parameters description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BUFFALOAFRICAN_APPEARANCE_SEX"
msgid ""
"Males have a hump just past their thick necks and can have hairy skin folds "
"and a dewlap under their chins."
msgstr ""
"Samci mají za silným krkem hrb. Pod bradou se jim mohou vytvářet osrstěné "
"kožní záhyby a lalok."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BUFFALOAFRICAN_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species African buffalo
#. description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BUFFALOAFRICAN_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"A large bovine that belongs to Africa's Big Five, African buffalos are known"
" as \"widowmakers\" and \"the Black Death\" for a reason. Their "
"unpredictability and wild temperament cause hundreds of people killed each "
"year."
msgstr ""
"Buvol africký patří mezi africkou velkou pětku. Přezdívá se mu „tvůrce vdov“"
" nebo „černá smrt“: je nepředvídatelný a útočný a každoročně má na svědomí "
"stovky lidských životů."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BUFFALOAFRICAN_HUNTING_BIOMES
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species African buffalo
#. biomes description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BUFFALOAFRICAN_HUNTING_BIOMES"
msgid ""
"Forests, grasslands, savannas, arid areas, in lower and higher "
"elevations—anywhere with permanent grass and water"
msgstr ""
"Lesy, travnaté pláně, savany i suché oblasti v různých nadmořských výškách, "
"pokud je tam trvalý zdroj trávy a vody"

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BUFFALOAFRICAN_HUNTING_STRENGTHS01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species African buffalo
#. strength against hunters 01"
