msgid "Syncerus caffer"
msgstr "Syncerus caffer"

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BUFFALOAFRICAN_TRIVIA01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species African buffalo
#. trivia fact 01"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BUFFALOAFRICAN_TRIVIA01"
msgid ""
"The adult African buffalo's horns are its characteristic feature. They have "
"fused bases, forming a continuous bone shield across the top of the head, "
"referred to as a \"boss.\""
msgstr ""
"Charakteristickým znakem dospělých buvolů afrických jsou rohy, jejichž "
"srostlé báze tvoří na temeni souvislý rohový štít."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BUFFALOAFRICAN_TRIVIA02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species African buffalo
#. trivia fact 02"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BUFFALOAFRICAN_TRIVIA02"
msgid ""
"When feeding, the Buffalo makes use of its tongue and wide incisor row to "
"eat grass more quickly than most other African herbivores."
msgstr ""
"Buvol africký při pastvě využívá jazyk a širokou řadu řezáků, takže spásá "
"trávu rychleji než většina ostatních afrických býložravců."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BUFFALOAFRICAN_TRIVIA03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species African buffalo
#. trivia fact 03"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BUFFALOAFRICAN_TRIVIA03"
msgid ""
"African buffalo are highly dependent on water and can consume 7.7 gal (35 l)"
" of water at a time in just a few minutes."
msgstr ""
"Buvol africký je silně závislý na vodě. Během několika minut dokáže najednou"
" vypít až 35 litrů."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BUFFALOAFRICAN_TRIVIA04
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species African buffalo
#. trivia fact 04"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BUFFALOAFRICAN_TRIVIA04"
msgid ""
"The African buffalo is an excellent swimmer and often crosses rivers in "
"search of better grazing."
msgstr ""
"Buvol africký výborně plave a při hledání lepší pastvy často překonává řeky."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BUFFALOAFRICAN_TRIVIA05
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species African buffalo
#. trivia fact 05"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BUFFALOAFRICAN_TRIVIA05"
msgid ""
"African buffalo cows are notable for exhibiting a kind of \"voting "
"behavior.\" During resting time, the females stand up, shuffle around, and "
"sit back down again. They sit facing the direction they think they should "
"travel in. After an hour of more shuffling, the females set off in the "
"direction chosen by the majority. This decision is usually communal and not "
"based on hierarchy or dominance."
msgstr ""
"Samice buvolů afrických při výběru směru cesty jakoby hlasují. Během "
"odpočinku vstávají, popocházejí a znovu si lehají čelem ke směru, kterým by "
"se chtěly vydat. Přibližně po hodině se vydají směrem, který zvolila "
"většina. Rozhodnutí bývá společné a obvykle nezávisí na hierarchii ani "
"dominanci ve stádě."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BUFFALOAFRICAN_TRIVIA06
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species African buffalo
#. trivia fact 06"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BUFFALOAFRICAN_TRIVIA06"
msgid ""
"African buffalo are known to engage in mobbing behavior when fighting off "
"predators. They have been recorded killing a lion, and chasing lions up "
"trees and keeping them there for two hours after the lions had killed a "
"member of their group."
msgstr ""
"Buvoli afričtí se proti predátorům brání společnými útoky. Jsou zaznamenány "
"případy, kdy zabili lva. Poté, co lvi usmrtili jednoho člena stáda, je "
"buvoli zahnali na stromy a drželi je tam dvě hodiny."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BUSTARD_APPEARANCE_AGE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Bustard age
#. variation description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BUSTARD_APPEARANCE_AGE"
msgid "Males develop markings with age and become more territorial."
msgstr ""
"Samcům se s věkem zvýrazňuje kresba opeření a výrazněji si hájí území."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BUSTARD_APPEARANCE_COAT
