#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BUSTARD_TRIVIA01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Bustard trivia fact
#. 01"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_BUSTARD_TRIVIA01"
msgid ""
"The male Korhaan will often run away from an intruder with its head and neck"
" extended, before suddenly freezing, becoming surprisingly difficult to see "
"in the process."
msgstr ""
"Samec dropa často utíká před vetřelcem s nataženou hlavou a krkem. Pak náhle"
" strne a díky maskovacímu zbarvení je obtížné ho zahlédnout."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_CROCODILE_APPEARANCE_AGE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Crocodile age
#. variation description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_CROCODILE_APPEARANCE_AGE"
msgid "The banding on adult bodies becomes fainter."
msgstr "Pruhy na těle dospělých krokodýlů postupně blednou."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_CROCODILE_APPEARANCE_COAT
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Crocodile coat
#. description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_CROCODILE_APPEARANCE_COAT"
msgid "Olive green to dark brown with darker crossbands on the back and tail"
msgstr ""
"Olivově zelená až tmavě hnědá s tmavšími příčnými pruhy na hřbetě a ocase"

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_CROCODILE_APPEARANCE_DIMENSIONS
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Crocodile sex
#. dimensions description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_CROCODILE_APPEARANCE_DIMENSIONS"
msgid ""
"Males are a fifth to a third larger and weigh significantly more than "
"females."
msgstr "Samci jsou o pětinu až třetinu větší a váží výrazně více než samice."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_CROCODILE_APPEARANCE_SEX
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Crocodile sex other
#. parameters description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_CROCODILE_APPEARANCE_SEX"
msgid ""
"No significant differences between females and males other than their sizes."
msgstr "Kromě velikosti se samci a samice výrazně neliší."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_CROCODILE_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "animal species Crocodile description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_CROCODILE_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"One of the largest apex predators of the freshwaters of Africa. It is "
"extremely aggressive and agile, with hundreds of human fatalities "
"contributing to its death toll each year."
msgstr ""
"Krokodýl nilský patří k největším vrcholovým predátorům afrických sladkých "
"vod. Je hbitý a agresivní a každoročně si vyžádá stovky lidských životů."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_CROCODILE_HUNTING_BIOMES
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Crocodile biomes
#. description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_CROCODILE_HUNTING_BIOMES"
msgid ""
"Broad rivers, lakes, marshes adjacent to open savanna, semi-desert, "
"woodlands"
msgstr "Široké řeky, jezera a bažiny u otevřených savan, polopouští či lesů"

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_CROCODILE_HUNTING_STRENGTHS01
