#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_CROCODILE_TRIVIA01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Crocodile trivia
#. fact 01"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_CROCODILE_TRIVIA01"
msgid ""
"Crocodiles have been found, together with their eggs, in Egyptian tombs."
msgstr "V egyptských hrobkách se našly pozůstatky krokodýlů i jejich vejce."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_CROCODILE_TRIVIA02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Crocodile trivia
#. fact 02"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_CROCODILE_TRIVIA02"
msgid ""
"Thanks to their slow metabolism, Crocodiles can go for days and even weeks "
"without eating."
msgstr ""
"Díky pomalému metabolismu vydrží krokodýli bez potravy celé dny, někdy i "
"týdny."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_CROCODILE_TRIVIA03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Crocodile trivia
#. fact 03"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_CROCODILE_TRIVIA03"
msgid "Adult Crocodiles help their hatchlings emerge from their eggs."
msgstr "Dospělí krokodýli pomáhají mláďatům při líhnutí z vajec."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_CROCODILE_TRIVIA04
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Crocodile trivia
#. fact 04"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_CROCODILE_TRIVIA04"
msgid ""
"When Crocodile hatchlings are under threat, their mother puts them into her "
"throat pouch."
msgstr ""
"Když mláďatům hrozí nebezpečí, krokodýlí matka je ukryje v hrdelním vaku."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_CROCODILE_TRIVIA05
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Crocodile trivia
#. fact 05"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_CROCODILE_TRIVIA05"
msgid "Crocodiles readily feed on dead Hippos."
msgstr "Krokodýli se ochotně živí mrtvými hrochy."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_DEERMULE_APPEARANCE_AGE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Mule deer age
#. variation description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_DEERMULE_APPEARANCE_AGE"
msgid "Older animals have their heads lowered and hackles raised."
msgstr "Starší jedinci mívají skloněnou hlavu a vztyčenou srst na šíji."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_DEERMULE_APPEARANCE_COAT
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Mule deer coat
#. description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_DEERMULE_APPEARANCE_COAT"
msgid ""
"Grayish-brown to reddish-brown, with a lighter coat on their undersides"
msgstr "Šedohnědé až červenohnědé, se světlejší srstí na spodní straně"

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_DEERMULE_APPEARANCE_DIMENSIONS
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Mule deer sex
#. dimensions description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_DEERMULE_APPEARANCE_DIMENSIONS"
msgid "Bucks are significantly larger than does."
msgstr "Samci bývají výrazně větší než samice."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_DEERMULE_APPEARANCE_SEX
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Mule deer sex other
#. parameters description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_DEERMULE_APPEARANCE_SEX"
msgid "Bucks grow antlers for competition and display."
msgstr "Samcům rostou parohy, kterými soupeří a předvádějí se před ostatními."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_DEERMULE_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "animal species Mule deer description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_DEERMULE_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"The mule deer is a species of deer that inhabits the western part of North "
"America. Their large ears resemble mule ears, but don't expect the mule deer"
" to be nearly as useful as a mule. Their tail is black, as opposed to the "
"white-tailed deer. When they raise their tail, usually when alert, a white "
"rump patch is visible under it."
msgstr ""
"Jelenec ušatý obývá západní část Severní Ameriky. Jeho velké uši připomínají"
" uši mezka, ale jeho užitečnost od jelence nečekejte. Na rozdíl od jelence "
"běloocasého má černý ocas; když jej při poplachu zvedne, objeví se pod ním "
"bílá skvrna na zádi."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_DEERMULE_HUNTING_BIOMES
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Mule deer biomes
#. description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_DEERMULE_HUNTING_BIOMES"
msgid ""
"Forests, grasslands, arid areas and mountains—practically anywhere, thanks "
"to its adaptability"
msgstr ""
"Lesy, travnaté pláně, suché oblasti i hory; díky přizpůsobivosti téměř všude"

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_DEERMULE_HUNTING_STRENGTHS01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Mule deer strength
#. against hunters 01"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_DEERMULE_HUNTING_STRENGTHS01"
msgid "Agile, capable of quick, erratic and swift movements"
msgstr "Je hbitý a dovede rychle a nepředvídatelně měnit směr."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_DEERMULE_HUNTING_STRENGTHS02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Mule deer strength
#. against hunters 02"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_DEERMULE_HUNTING_STRENGTHS02"
msgid "Navigating diverse terrains with ease"
msgstr "Snadno se pohybuje v různorodém terénu."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_DEERMULE_HUNTING_STRENGTHS03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Mule deer strength
#. against hunters 03"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_DEERMULE_HUNTING_STRENGTHS03"
msgid "Good camouflage with their coat"
msgstr "Zbarvení srsti mu poskytuje dobré maskování."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_DEERMULE_HUNTING_STRENGTHS04
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Mule deer strength
#. against hunters 04"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_DEERMULE_HUNTING_STRENGTHS04"
msgid "Inactive during day"
msgstr "Přes den bývá méně aktivní."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_DEERMULE_HUNTING_WEAKNESSES01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Mule deer weakness
#. against hunters 01"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_DEERMULE_HUNTING_WEAKNESSES01"
msgid "Predictable movements"
msgstr "Jeho pohyb lze někdy předvídat."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_DEERMULE_HUNTING_WEAKNESSES02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Mule deer weakness
#. against hunters 02"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_DEERMULE_HUNTING_WEAKNESSES02"
msgid "Habitual and seasonal patterns"
msgstr "Pravidelné návyky a změny chování podle ročního období"

