msgid "Lepus"
msgstr "Lepus"

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_HIPPOPOTAMUS_APPEARANCE_AGE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Hippopotamus age
#. variation description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_HIPPOPOTAMUS_APPEARANCE_AGE"
msgid "Adults are more aggressive."
msgstr "Dospělí jsou agresivnější."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_HIPPOPOTAMUS_APPEARANCE_COAT
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Hippopotamus coat
#. description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_HIPPOPOTAMUS_APPEARANCE_COAT"
msgid "Grayish-brown to blue-black"
msgstr "Šedohnědý až modročerný"

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_HIPPOPOTAMUS_APPEARANCE_DIMENSIONS
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Hippopotamus sex
#. dimensions description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_HIPPOPOTAMUS_APPEARANCE_DIMENSIONS"
msgid ""
"Bulls have slightly larger bodies and tusks. Bulls have much heavier jaws."
msgstr ""
"Samci mají o něco mohutnější tělo a větší kly. Jejich čelisti jsou také "
"výrazně těžší."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_HIPPOPOTAMUS_APPEARANCE_SEX
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Hippopotamus sex
#. other parameters description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_HIPPOPOTAMUS_APPEARANCE_SEX"
msgid ""
"Bulls and cows don't exhibit differences other than their slight variation "
"in sizes."
msgstr ""
"Samci a samice se kromě nepatrného rozdílu ve velikosti výrazně neliší."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_HIPPOPOTAMUS_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Hippopotamus
#. description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_HIPPOPOTAMUS_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Hippos, the third-largest land mammals after Elephants and Rhinos, are "
"social while in water, but typically solitary when grazing on land."
msgstr ""
"Hroch je po slonovi a nosorožci třetím největším suchozemským savcem. Ve "
"vodě žije společensky, při pastvě na souši se však obvykle pohybuje sám."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_HIPPOPOTAMUS_HUNTING_BIOMES
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Hippopotamus biomes
#. description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_HIPPOPOTAMUS_HUNTING_BIOMES"
msgid "Shallow lakes, rivers, swamps"
msgstr "Mělká jezera, řeky a bažiny"

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_HIPPOPOTAMUS_HUNTING_STRENGTHS01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Hippopotamus
#. strength against hunters 01"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_HIPPOPOTAMUS_HUNTING_STRENGTHS01"
msgid "Size and aggression"
msgstr "Mohutné tělo a útočnost"

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_HIPPOPOTAMUS_HUNTING_STRENGTHS02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Hippopotamus
#. strength against hunters 02"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_HIPPOPOTAMUS_HUNTING_STRENGTHS02"
msgid "Tough body"
msgstr "Odolné tělo"

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_HIPPOPOTAMUS_HUNTING_WEAKNESSES01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Hippopotamus
#. weakness against hunters 01"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_HIPPOPOTAMUS_HUNTING_WEAKNESSES01"
msgid "Predictable life cycle"
msgstr "Předvídatelný denní režim"

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_HIPPOPOTAMUS_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "animal species Hippopotamus name"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "DayOnePatch"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_HIPPOPOTAMUS_NAME"
msgid "Hippopotamus"
msgstr "Hroch obojživelný"

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_HIPPOPOTAMUS_NAME_ALTERNATIVE01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Hippopotamus name,
#. alternative 01"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "DayOnePatch"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_HIPPOPOTAMUS_NAME_ALTERNATIVE01"
msgid "Hippo"
msgstr "Hroch obojživelný"

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_HIPPOPOTAMUS_NAME_LATIN
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:	"MetaData.Gather" : "False"
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Hippopotamus name,
#. Latin"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "DayOnePatch"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_HIPPOPOTAMUS_NAME_LATIN"
msgid "Hippopotamus amphibius"
msgstr "Hippopotamus amphibius"

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_HIPPOPOTAMUS_TRIVIA01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Hippopotamus trivia
#. fact 01"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_HIPPOPOTAMUS_TRIVIA01"
msgid "A Hippo's stomach can store 2 daily portions of grass."
msgstr "Hrochův žaludek pojme přibližně dvojnásobek jeho denní dávky trávy."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_HIPPOPOTAMUS_TRIVIA02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Hippopotamus trivia
#. fact 02"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_HIPPOPOTAMUS_TRIVIA02"
msgid "Hippos can survive up to 3 weeks without food."
msgstr "Hroši mohou přežít až 3 týdny bez potravy."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_HIPPOPOTAMUS_TRIVIA03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Hippopotamus trivia
#. fact 03"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_HIPPOPOTAMUS_TRIVIA03"
msgid ""
"Small animals such as turtles or baby crocodiles occasionally sunbathe on "
"hippos."
msgstr ""
"Na hroších se občas vyhřívají malá zvířata, například želvy nebo krokodýlí "
"mláďata."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_HYENA_APPEARANCE_AGE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Hyena age variation
#. description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_HYENA_APPEARANCE_AGE"
msgid "Adult animals are more muscular."
msgstr "Dospělá zvířata jsou svalnatější."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_HYENA_APPEARANCE_COAT
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Hyena coat
#. description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_HYENA_APPEARANCE_COAT"
msgid "Light brown with dark spots"
msgstr "Světle hnědá s tmavými skvrnami"

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_HYENA_APPEARANCE_DIMENSIONS
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Hyena sex dimensions
#. description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_HYENA_APPEARANCE_DIMENSIONS"
msgid "Females are larger than males."
msgstr "Samice jsou větší než samci."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_HYENA_APPEARANCE_SEX
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Hyena sex other
#. parameters description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_HYENA_APPEARANCE_SEX"
msgid ""
"Females are dominant and more aggressive. They have masculinized genitalia "
"(\"pseudo-penis\")."
msgstr ""
"Samice jsou dominantní a agresivnější. Mají samčím pohlavním orgánům podobné"
" genitálie (takzvaný pseudopenis)."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_HYENA_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "animal species Hyena description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_HYENA_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Frequently classified wrongly as dogs, the Hyena's ancestors are actually "
"closer to the cat family. As one of the smallest land carnivorans, it "
"compensates for its size with behaviors that are considered contemptuous and"
" frightening, but are actually much more complex and sophisticated."
msgstr ""
"Hyeny se někdy mylně řadí ke psovitým šelmám, příbuznější jsou však "
"kočkovitým. Jejich chování bývá líčeno jako odpudivé a děsivé, ve "
"skutečnosti je ale velmi složité."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_HYENA_HUNTING_BIOMES
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Hyena biomes
#. description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_HYENA_HUNTING_BIOMES"
msgid ""
"Semi-deserts, savannas, mountainous forests, avoiding dense forests and "
"coastal rainforests"
msgstr ""
"Polopouště, savany a horské lesy; hustým lesům a pobřežním deštným pralesům "
"se vyhýbá"

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_HYENA_HUNTING_STRENGTHS01
