#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_HYENA_TRIVIA01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "animal species Hyena trivia fact 01"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_HYENA_TRIVIA01"
msgid ""
"A Hyena's heart is double the size of that of most mammals of a similar "
"size."
msgstr ""
"Srdce hyeny je asi dvakrát větší než srdce většiny podobně velkých savců."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_HYENA_TRIVIA02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "animal species Hyena trivia fact 02"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_HYENA_TRIVIA02"
msgid ""
"Hyena fossils have been discovered in Africa, North America, Asia and "
"Europe. But for the past 8,000 years, spotted hyenas have only lived in "
"Africa."
msgstr ""
"Fosilie hyen se našly v Africe, Severní Americe, Asii i Evropě. Posledních "
"osm tisíc let však hyeny skvrnité žijí pouze v Africe."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_HYENA_TRIVIA03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "animal species Hyena trivia fact 03"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_HYENA_TRIVIA03"
msgid ""
"The Hyena is the only predator with jaws that are strong enough to rip "
"elephant hide and crush elephant bone."
msgstr ""
"Hyena má mimořádně silné čelisti. Dokáže roztrhnout sloní kůži a rozdrtit "
"sloní kosti."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_HYENA_TRIVIA04
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "animal species Hyena trivia fact 04"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_HYENA_TRIVIA04"
msgid ""
"Hyenas can digest items that most animals cannot, such as bones and skin. "
"Special stomach acids break down these animal parts."
msgstr ""
"Hyeny dokážou strávit i kosti a kůži. Tyto části kořisti rozkládají silné "
"žaludeční kyseliny."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_IMPALA_APPEARANCE_AGE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Impala age variation
#. description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_IMPALA_APPEARANCE_AGE"
msgid "Adults gain fully spiraled horns."
msgstr "Dospělí získají plně spirálovité rohy."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_IMPALA_APPEARANCE_COAT
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Impala coat
#. description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_IMPALA_APPEARANCE_COAT"
msgid ""
"Reddish-brown, with white underparts and black markings on the face and legs"
msgstr ""
"Červenohnědá srst s bílým břichem a černými znaky na hlavě a končetinách"

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_IMPALA_APPEARANCE_DIMENSIONS
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Impala sex
#. dimensions description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_IMPALA_APPEARANCE_DIMENSIONS"
msgid "Males are noticeably larger than females."
msgstr "Samci jsou znatelně větší než samice."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_IMPALA_APPEARANCE_SEX
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Impala sex other
#. parameters description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_IMPALA_APPEARANCE_SEX"
msgid "Males have horns and are more muscular."
msgstr "Samci mají rohy a jsou svalnatější."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_IMPALA_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "animal species Impala description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_IMPALA_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"A medium-sized antelope that uses characteristic leaps to confuse and escape"
" from predators. A famous Australian band was named after it for a reason."
msgstr ""
"Impala je středně velká antilopa, která predátory mate prudkými skoky a "
"uniká jim. Je po ní pojmenována i známá australská kapela."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_IMPALA_HUNTING_BIOMES
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Impala biomes
#. description\nchanged during localization"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_IMPALA_HUNTING_BIOMES"
msgid ""
"Grasslands or woodlands with little undergrowth and abundance of either "
"water or low-to-medium grass"
msgstr ""
"Travnaté pláně nebo lesy s řídkým podrostem a dostatkem vody či nízké až "
"středně vysoké trávy"

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_IMPALA_HUNTING_STRENGTHS01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Impala strength
#. against hunters 01"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_IMPALA_HUNTING_STRENGTHS01"
msgid "Speed and agility"
msgstr "Rychlost a obratnost"

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_IMPALA_HUNTING_STRENGTHS02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Impala strength
#. against hunters 02"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_IMPALA_HUNTING_STRENGTHS02"
msgid "Group vigilance"
msgstr "Bdělost celého stáda"

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_IMPALA_HUNTING_WEAKNESSES01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Impala weakness
#. against hunters 01"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_IMPALA_HUNTING_WEAKNESSES01"
msgid "Dependent on water and predictable near its sources"
msgstr "Zdržuje se u vodních zdrojů, kde lze její pohyb předvídat"

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_IMPALA_HUNTING_WEAKNESSES02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Impala weakness
#. against hunters 02"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_IMPALA_HUNTING_WEAKNESSES02"
msgid "Flees in predictable directions"
msgstr "Často prchá předvídatelným směrem"

