msgstr "Kudu"

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_KUDU_NAME_LATIN
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:	"MetaData.Gather" : "False"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "animal species Kudu name, Latin"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "DayOnePatch"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_KUDU_NAME_LATIN"
msgid "Tragelaphus"
msgstr "Tragelaphus"

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_KUDU_TRIVIA01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "animal species Kudu trivia fact 01"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_KUDU_TRIVIA01"
msgid ""
"Their deceptive coloring and markings protect Kudus by camouflaging them. If"
" alarmed, they usually stand still and are very difficult to spot."
msgstr ""
"Kudu chrání maskovací zbarvení a kresba srsti. Při poplachu často zůstane "
"nehybně stát, takže je těžké ho spatřit."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_LION_APPEARANCE_AGE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Lion age variation
#. description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_LION_APPEARANCE_AGE"
msgid ""
"Younger Lions are more playful and may not actively participate in pride "
"protection."
msgstr ""
"Mladí lvi bývají hravější a do ochrany smečky se ještě nemusejí aktivně "
"zapojovat."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_LION_APPEARANCE_COAT
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "animal species Lion coat description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_LION_APPEARANCE_COAT"
msgid "Tawny, ranges from light beige to deep golden brown"
msgstr "Plavá srst od světle béžové po sytě zlatohnědou"

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_LION_APPEARANCE_DIMENSIONS
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Lion sex dimensions
#. description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_LION_APPEARANCE_DIMENSIONS"
msgid "Males are larger and up to twice as heavy as females."
msgstr "Samci jsou větší a až dvakrát těžší než samice."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_LION_APPEARANCE_SEX
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Lion sex other
#. parameters description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_LION_APPEARANCE_SEX"
msgid "Males grow a mane."
msgstr "Samcům narůstá hříva."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_LION_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "animal species Lion description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_LION_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"A large cat native to Africa and India, lions are keystone and apex "
"predators, as well as the ultimate symbol of the animal kingdom. They are "
"highly social, forming groups called prides, and exceptionally dangerous "
"when they feel threatened and have backup to call on."
msgstr ""
"Lev je velká kočkovitá šelma původem z Afriky a Indie. Patří k vrcholovým "
"predátorům, hraje klíčovou roli v ekosystému a je symbolem zvířecí říše. Je "
"velmi společenský a žije ve smečkách. Když se cítí ohrožen a má podporu "
"ostatních lvů, může být mimořádně nebezpečný."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_LION_HUNTING_BIOMES
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Lion biomes
#. description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_LION_HUNTING_BIOMES"
msgid ""
"Savanna with sufficient cover as well as forests, semi-deserts, mountains, "
"avoiding deserts and tropical rainforests"
msgstr ""
"Savany s dostatkem krytu, lesy, polopouště a hory; pouštím a tropickým "
"deštným pralesům se vyhýbá"

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_LION_HUNTING_STRENGTHS01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Lion strength
#. against hunters 01"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_LION_HUNTING_STRENGTHS01"
msgid "Coordinated packs make them more dangerous"
msgstr "Spolupráce ve smečce zvyšuje jeho nebezpečnost"

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_LION_HUNTING_WEAKNESSES01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Lion weakness
#. against hunters 01"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_LION_HUNTING_WEAKNESSES01"
msgid "Easily spotted in open areas during the day"
msgstr "Ve dne je na otevřených prostranstvích snadno vidět"

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_LION_HUNTING_WEAKNESSES02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Lion weakness
#. against hunters 02"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_LION_HUNTING_WEAKNESSES02"
msgid "Vulnerable to coordinated ambushes"
msgstr "Zranitelný vůči koordinovaným přepadům"

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_LION_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "animal species Lion name"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "DayOnePatch"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_LION_NAME"
msgid "Lion"
msgstr "Lev"

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_LION_NAME_LATIN
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:	"MetaData.Gather" : "False"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "animal species Lion name, Latin"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "DayOnePatch"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_LION_NAME_LATIN"
msgid "Panthera leo"
msgstr "Panthera leo"

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_LION_TRIVIA01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "animal species Lion trivia fact 01"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_LION_TRIVIA01"
msgid ""
"African lions are highly social animals, gathering in groups or prides, "
"which include up to 3 male lions and multiple lionesses with their young."
msgstr ""
"Lvi afričtí jsou společenští a žijí ve smečkách, které mohou tvořit až tři "
"samci a několik lvic s mláďaty."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_LION_TRIVIA02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "animal species Lion trivia fact 02"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_LION_TRIVIA02"
msgid "The female Lion gives birth in a hidden, solitary nursery."
msgstr "Lvice rodí mláďata v odlehlém, dobře ukrytém doupěti."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_LION_TRIVIA03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "animal species Lion trivia fact 03"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_LION_TRIVIA03"
msgid "Lions prefer to hunt at dusk."
msgstr "Lvi raději loví za soumraku."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_LION_TRIVIA04
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "animal species Lion trivia fact 04"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_LION_TRIVIA04"
msgid ""
"Lions spend much of their time resting to save energy, especially in the "
"absence of prey."
msgstr ""
"Lvi věnují velkou část dne odpočinku, aby šetřili síly, zejména když není "
"dostupná kořist."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_LION_TRIVIA05
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "animal species Lion trivia fact 05"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_LION_TRIVIA05"
msgid ""
"If another male Lion overcomes the leading male of the pride, he usually "
"kills all the cubs sired by the previous leader."
msgstr ""
"Když cizí samec převezme smečku, často zabije mláďata předchozího vůdčího "
"samce."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_LION_TRIVIA06
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "animal species Lion trivia fact 06"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_LION_TRIVIA06"
msgid ""
"Male Lions tend not to hunt, due to their slow speed and eye-catching "
"appearance. Hunting is left to the females of the pride, who cooperate with "
"each other during their hunting trips."
msgstr ""
"Lví samci loví méně často. Jejich nápadný vzhled a menší rychlost je při "
"lovu znevýhodňují. Kořist obvykle společně loví lvice ze smečky."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_LION_TRIVIA07
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "animal species Lion trivia fact 07"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_LION_TRIVIA07"
msgid ""
"Lions most often roar at night, a sound that can be heard from a distance of"
" 5 mi (8 km) away."
msgstr ""
"Lví řev se nejčastěji ozývá v noci a může být slyšet až na osm kilometrů."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_MOOSE_APPEARANCE_AGE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Moose age variation
#. description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_MOOSE_APPEARANCE_AGE"
msgid "Adults become solitary."
msgstr "Dospělí se stávají samotáři."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_MOOSE_APPEARANCE_COAT
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Moose coat
#. description\nchanged during localization batch 2"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_MOOSE_APPEARANCE_COAT"
msgid ""
"Light brown, sometimes with a reddish hue, to dark brown and almost black"
msgstr ""
"Světle hnědá, někdy s načervenalým odstínem, až tmavě hnědá a téměř černá"

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_MOOSE_APPEARANCE_DIMENSIONS
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Moose sex dimensions
#. description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_MOOSE_APPEARANCE_DIMENSIONS"
msgid "Bulls are noticeably larger and weigh a half more than cows."
msgstr "Samci jsou výrazně větší a asi o polovinu těžší než samice."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_MOOSE_APPEARANCE_SEX
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Moose sex other
#. parameters description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_MOOSE_APPEARANCE_SEX"
msgid "Males have antlers and are more solitary."
msgstr "Samci mají parohy a jsou spíše samotáři."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_MOOSE_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "animal species Moose description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_MOOSE_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"The largest deer species, inhabiting North America, Europe, and Asia, they "
"are known for their love of cooler biomes with plenty of water. Moose have "
"broad, palmate antlers, a marked distinction from other deer with more "
"pointed antlers."
msgstr ""
"Los je největší jelenovitý savec. Žije v Severní Americe, Evropě a Asii, "
"převážně v chladnějších oblastech s dostatkem vody. Od většiny ostatních "
"jelenovitých se liší širokým, lopatovitým parožím."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_MOOSE_HUNTING_BIOMES
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Moose biomes
#. description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_MOOSE_HUNTING_BIOMES"
msgid ""
"Forested areas with moist conditions, either in swamps or with lakes and "
"ponds nearby"
msgstr "Vlhké lesy u bažin, jezer a rybníků"

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_MOOSE_HUNTING_STRENGTHS01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Moose strength
#. against hunters 01"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_MOOSE_HUNTING_STRENGTHS01"
msgid "Large size and strength"
msgstr "Mohutné tělo a síla"

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_MOOSE_HUNTING_WEAKNESSES01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Moose weakness
#. against hunters 01"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_MOOSE_HUNTING_WEAKNESSES01"
msgid "Solitary behavior, making them easy to track"
msgstr "Žije samotářsky, takže jeho stopy lze snadněji sledovat"

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_MOOSE_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "animal species Moose name"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "DayOnePatch"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_MOOSE_NAME"
msgid "Moose"
msgstr "Los"

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_MOOSE_NAME_ALTERNATIVE01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Moose name,
#. alternative 01"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "DayOnePatch"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_MOOSE_NAME_ALTERNATIVE01"
msgid "Elk"
msgstr "Los"

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_MOOSE_NAME_LATIN
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:	"MetaData.Gather" : "False"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "animal species Moose name, Latin"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "DayOnePatch"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_MOOSE_NAME_LATIN"
msgid "Alces alces"
msgstr "Alces alces"

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_MOOSE_TRIVIA01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "animal species Moose trivia fact 01"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_MOOSE_TRIVIA01"
msgid ""
"Moose bulls make heavy grunting sounds that can be heard from up to 1,600 ft"
" (500 m) away."
msgstr ""
"Losí samci vydávají hluboké hrdelní zvuky, které lze slyšet až ze "
"vzdálenosti 500 metrů."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_MOOSE_TRIVIA02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "animal species Moose trivia fact 02"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_MOOSE_TRIVIA02"
msgid ""
"Although generally slow-moving and sedentary, Moose can become aggressive, "
"and move quickly if angered or startled."
msgstr ""
"Ačkoli se los obvykle pohybuje pomalu a mnoho času tráví na jednom místě, "
"při vyrušení nebo podráždění může být agresivní a překvapivě rychlý."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_MOOSE_TRIVIA03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "animal species Moose trivia fact 03"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_MOOSE_TRIVIA03"
msgid ""
"Moose are able to dive over 18 ft (5.5 m) to reach plants on lakebeds. Their"
" complex snouts assist them in this type of feeding."
msgstr ""
"Losi se dokážou ponořit do hloubky více než 5,5 metru pro vodní rostliny. "
"Pomáhá jim při tom stavba jejich nozder."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_MOOSE_TRIVIA04
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "animal species Moose trivia fact 04"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_MOOSE_TRIVIA04"
msgid ""
"As an adaptation for feeding on plants underwater, Moose noses have "
"developed fatty pads, and muscles that close the nostrils when exposed to "
"water pressure, preventing water from entering the nose."
msgstr ""
"Při spásání vodních rostlin losům pomáhají tukové polštářky a svaly v "
"nozdrách. Pod vodou nozdry uzavřou, aby se do nich nedostala voda."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_OSTRICH_APPEARANCE_AGE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Ostrich age
#. variation description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_OSTRICH_APPEARANCE_AGE"
msgid "Adults lose their colored stripes."
msgstr "Dospělí ztrácejí své barevné pruhy."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_OSTRICH_APPEARANCE_COAT
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Ostrich coat
#. description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_OSTRICH_APPEARANCE_COAT"
msgid "Black, white, grayish-brown, seasonally redder plumes"
msgstr ""
"Černé, bílé a šedohnědé opeření, v některých obdobích s načervenalým "
"nádechem"

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_OSTRICH_APPEARANCE_DIMENSIONS
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Ostrich sex
#. dimensions description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_OSTRICH_APPEARANCE_DIMENSIONS"
msgid "Males are noticeably higher and slightly heavier than females."
msgstr "Samci jsou znatelně vyšší a o něco těžší než samice."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_OSTRICH_APPEARANCE_SEX
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Ostrich sex other
#. parameters description"
