#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_OSTRICH_TRIVIA01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Ostrich trivia fact
#. 01"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_OSTRICH_TRIVIA01"
msgid ""
"Ostriches have great vision: their big eyes are the largest of any land "
"vertebrate."
msgstr ""
"Pštrosi mají skvělý zrak: jejich velké oči jsou největší ze všech "
"suchozemských obratlovců."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_OSTRICH_TRIVIA02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Ostrich trivia fact
#. 02"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_OSTRICH_TRIVIA02"
msgid ""
"Unlike other birds, Ostriches have two toes on each foot, considered to be "
"an aid for faster running."
msgstr ""
"Pštros má na každé noze pouze dva prsty. To mu pravděpodobně pomáhá při "
"rychlém běhu."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_OSTRICH_TRIVIA03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Ostrich trivia fact
#. 03"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_OSTRICH_TRIVIA03"
msgid ""
"In the past, Ostriches roamed all over Africa, Asia, and the Arabian "
"Peninsula."
msgstr "V minulosti žili pštrosi v Africe, Asii i na Arabském poloostrově."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_OSTRICH_TRIVIA04
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Ostrich trivia fact
#. 04"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_OSTRICH_TRIVIA04"
msgid ""
"Ostriches like water. They frequently take baths and are surprisingly good "
"swimmers."
msgstr ""
"Pštrosi mají rádi vodu. Často se koupou a jsou překvapivě dobří plavci."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_OSTRICH_TRIVIA05
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Ostrich trivia fact
#. 05"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_OSTRICH_TRIVIA05"
msgid ""
"Ostriches don't bury their heads in the sand to avoid danger. This myth "
"probably comes from the occasions when ostriches lie down and extend their "
"necks."
msgstr ""
"Pštrosi při nebezpečí nestrkají hlavu do písku. Tento mýtus zřejmě vznikl, "
"když lidé spatřili pštrosa ležet s nataženým krkem."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_OSTRICH_TRIVIA06
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Ostrich trivia fact
#. 06"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_OSTRICH_TRIVIA06"
msgid ""
"Ostriches are very vocal, and their sounds include whistling, booming, "
"snorting, and hissing."
msgstr "Pštrosi se hlasitě ozývají: pískají, dunivě volají, frkají a syčí."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_OSTRICH_TRIVIA07
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Ostrich trivia fact
#. 07"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_OSTRICH_TRIVIA07"
msgid ""
"Ostriches are attracted to small, shiny objects, and will peck curiously at "
"them."
msgstr "Pštrosy přitahují drobné lesklé předměty, do kterých zvědavě klovou."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_PRONGHORN_APPEARANCE_AGE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Pronghorn age
#. variation description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_PRONGHORN_APPEARANCE_AGE"
msgid "Adults are not only faster, they also boast improved stamina."
msgstr "Dospělí jedinci jsou rychlejší a mají větší výdrž."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_PRONGHORN_APPEARANCE_COAT
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Pronghorn coat
#. description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_PRONGHORN_APPEARANCE_COAT"
msgid "Tan to reddish-brown"
msgstr "Světle hnědá až červenohnědá srst"

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_PRONGHORN_APPEARANCE_DIMENSIONS
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Pronghorn sex
#. dimensions description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_PRONGHORN_APPEARANCE_DIMENSIONS"
msgid "Males are slightly larger and heavier than females."
msgstr "Samci jsou o něco větší a těžší než samice."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_PRONGHORN_APPEARANCE_SEX
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Pronghorn sex other
#. parameters description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_PRONGHORN_APPEARANCE_SEX"
msgid ""
"Females have smaller, sometimes barely visible horns. Males have larger "
"horns that are shaped like a lyre. Males also have a wide black mask running"
" from their eyes to their noses, as well as black patches on their necks."
msgstr ""
"Samice mají menší, někdy sotva patrné rohy. Samci mají větší rohy lyrovitého"
" tvaru, široký černý pruh od očí k nosu a černé skvrny na krku."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_PRONGHORN_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "animal species Pronghorn description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_PRONGHORN_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"This is not an antelope! Despite looking like antelopes, pronghorns are "
"actually more closely related to giraffes, essentially being an alternative "
"what-if scenario for Africa's most towering creature."
msgstr ""
"Vidloroh není antilopa, i když ji vzhledem připomíná. Je vývojově bližší "
"žirafám a představuje zcela jinou větev sudokopytníků."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_PRONGHORN_HUNTING_BIOMES
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Pronghorn biomes
#. description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_PRONGHORN_HUNTING_BIOMES"
msgid "Grasslands, shrublands, deserts"
msgstr "Travnaté pláně, křoviny a pouště"

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_PRONGHORN_HUNTING_STRENGTHS01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Pronghorn strength
