#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_RATEL_APPEARANCE_DIMENSIONS"
msgid "Males are larger and weigh almost twice as much as females."
msgstr "Samci jsou větší a váží téměř dvakrát tolik co samice."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_RATEL_APPEARANCE_SEX
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Ratel sex other
#. parameters description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_RATEL_APPEARANCE_SEX"
msgid "Males are more aggressive."
msgstr "Samci jsou agresivnější."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_RATEL_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "animal species Ratel description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_RATEL_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"One of the toughest animals out there, despite their size. Honey badgers are"
" ferocious when their life is under threat, and they can overpower predators"
" much larger than themselves."
msgstr ""
"Medojed kapský patří navzdory své velikosti k nejhouževnatějším šelmám. Když"
" je ohrožen, brání se zuřivě a dokáže přemoci i mnohem většího protivníka."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_RATEL_HUNTING_BIOMES
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Ratel biomes
#. description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_RATEL_HUNTING_BIOMES"
msgid ""
"Forests, grasslands, steppes, rocky hills and deserts—practically everywhere"
msgstr "Lesy, travnaté pláně, stepi, skalnaté vrchy i pouště; téměř všude"

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_RATEL_HUNTING_STRENGTHS01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Ratel strength
#. against hunters 01"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_RATEL_HUNTING_STRENGTHS01"
msgid "Thick skin and resilience"
msgstr "Silná kůže a vysoká odolnost"

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_RATEL_HUNTING_WEAKNESSES01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Ratel weakness
#. against hunters 01"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_RATEL_HUNTING_WEAKNESSES01"
msgid "Prefers to be solitary"
msgstr "Žije převážně samotářsky"

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_RATEL_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "animal species Ratel name"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "DayOnePatch"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_RATEL_NAME"
msgid "Honey badger"
msgstr "Medojed kapský"

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_RATEL_NAME_ALTERNATIVE01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Ratel name,
#. alternative"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "DayOnePatch"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_RATEL_NAME_ALTERNATIVE01"
msgid "Ratel"
msgstr "Medojed kapský"

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_RATEL_NAME_LATIN
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:	"MetaData.Gather" : "False"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "animal species Ratel name, Latin"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "DayOnePatch"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_RATEL_NAME_LATIN"
msgid "Mellivora capensis"
msgstr "Mellivora capensis"

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_RATEL_TRIVIA01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "animal species Ratel trivia fact 01"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_RATEL_TRIVIA01"
msgid ""
"Despite its name, the Honey badger does not closely resemble other badger "
"species. Rather, it bears more anatomical similarities to the Weasel."
msgstr ""
"Anglický název spojuje medojeda kapského s jezevci, ale příliš se jim "
"nepodobá. Stavbou těla připomíná spíše lasici."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_RATEL_TRIVIA02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "animal species Ratel trivia fact 02"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_RATEL_TRIVIA02"
msgid ""
"Because of the toughness and looseness of their skin, Honey badgers are very"
" difficult to hunt with dogs."
msgstr ""
"Medojed kapský má pevnou a volnou kůži, což psům ztěžuje jeho uchopení při "
"lovu."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_RATEL_TRIVIA03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "animal species Ratel trivia fact 03"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_RATEL_TRIVIA03"
msgid ""
"Honey badgers are known to find and feed on honey. In addition, they eat bee"
" larvae, shrugging off the attacking swarms of Africanized honey bees, "
"otherwise known as \"killer bees\"."
msgstr ""
"Medojed kapský vyhledává med i včelí larvy. Při dobývání hnízda odolává "
"útokům rozzuřených včel."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_RATEL_TRIVIA04
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "animal species Ratel trivia fact 04"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_RATEL_TRIVIA04"
msgid ""
"The Boran people use Honey badgers when looking for honey: they use a "
"special whistle, which attracts birds called honeyguides to the area."
msgstr ""
"Boranové při hledání medu zvláštním hvizdem přivolávají medozvěstky. Tito "
"ptáci je mohou dovést ke včelím hnízdům."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_RATEL_TRIVIA05
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "animal species Ratel trivia fact 05"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_RATEL_TRIVIA05"
msgid ""
"Honey badgers, led to a beehive by a species of birds called the honeyguide,"
" usually smash the hive first, eating larvae, after which the honeyguide "
"flies into the beehive, eating any scraps left behind."
msgstr ""
"Podle známého vyprávění mohou medozvěstky dovést medojeda kapského ke "
"včelímu hnízdu. Medojed ho rozbije a sežere larvy, pták pak využije zbytky."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_RATEL_TRIVIA06
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "animal species Ratel trivia fact 06"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_RATEL_TRIVIA06"
msgid ""
"Honey badgers are amazingly powerful and speedy diggers. In just a few "
"minutes, the animal can dig a deep hole in the hard ground, where it can "
"hide."
msgstr ""
"Medojed kapský je silný a rychlý hrabáč. V tvrdé zemi si dokáže během "
"několika minut vyhrabat hlubokou noru, v níž se ukryje."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_RATEL_TRIVIA07
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "animal species Ratel trivia fact 07"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_RATEL_TRIVIA07"
msgid "The Honey badger has been rumored to dig up human corpses."
msgstr "Podle některých zpráv medojed kapský vyhrabává i lidské ostatky."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_SHEEPTHINHORN_APPEARANCE_AGE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Thinhorn sheep age
#. variation description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_SHEEPTHINHORN_APPEARANCE_AGE"
msgid "Adults develop curled horns."
msgstr "Dospělým se vyvinou stočené rohy."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_SHEEPTHINHORN_APPEARANCE_COAT
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Thinhorn sheep coat
#. description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_SHEEPTHINHORN_APPEARANCE_COAT"
msgid "White, sometimes cream- and gray-colored"
msgstr "Bílá, někdy krémová a šedá"

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_SHEEPTHINHORN_APPEARANCE_DIMENSIONS
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Thinhorn sheep sex
#. dimensions description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_SHEEPTHINHORN_APPEARANCE_DIMENSIONS"
msgid "Rams are significantly larger and can be twice as heavy as ewes."
msgstr ""
"Berani jsou výrazně větší a mohou dosahovat až dvojnásobku hmotnosti bahnic."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_SHEEPTHINHORN_APPEARANCE_SEX
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Thinhorn sheep sex
#. other parameters description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_SHEEPTHINHORN_APPEARANCE_SEX"
msgid "Rams have more curled horns that they use to compete with other rams."
msgstr "Berani mají výrazněji stočené rohy, kterými soupeří s jinými berany."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_SHEEPTHINHORN_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Thinhorn sheep
#. description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_SHEEPTHINHORN_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Browsers of alpine slopes in western Canada and Alaska. Despite their name, "
"their curling horns can still get relatively thick. They prefer to avoid "
"areas with lots of snow if possible."
msgstr ""
"Ovce aljašská spásá rostliny na horských svazích západní Kanady a Aljašky. "
"Navzdory anglickému názvu může mít poměrně mohutné zatočené rohy. Pokud "
"může, vyhýbá se oblastem s hlubokým sněhem."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_SHEEPTHINHORN_HUNTING_BIOMES
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Thinhorn sheep
#. biomes description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_SHEEPTHINHORN_HUNTING_BIOMES"
msgid ""
"Mountain ranges with steep, rugged cliffs, coming lower to grasslands and "
"meadows for feeding"
msgstr ""
"Horské oblasti se strmými skalami; za potravou sestupuje na travnaté pláně a"
" louky"

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_SHEEPTHINHORN_HUNTING_STRENGTHS01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Thinhorn sheep
#. strength against hunters 01"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_SHEEPTHINHORN_HUNTING_STRENGTHS01"
msgid "Very agile in rugged terrain"
msgstr "Velmi obratná v členitém terénu"

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_SHEEPTHINHORN_HUNTING_WEAKNESSES01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Thinhorn sheep
#. weakness against hunters 01"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_SHEEPTHINHORN_HUNTING_WEAKNESSES01"
msgid "Open terrain habitats"
msgstr "Zdržuje se v otevřené horské krajině"

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_SHEEPTHINHORN_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "animal species Thinhorn sheep name"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "DayOnePatch"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_SHEEPTHINHORN_NAME"
msgid "Thinhorn sheep"
msgstr "Ovce aljašská"

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_SHEEPTHINHORN_NAME_LATIN
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:	"MetaData.Gather" : "False"
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Thinhorn sheep name,
#. Latin"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "DayOnePatch"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_SHEEPTHINHORN_NAME_LATIN"
msgid "Ovis dalli"
msgstr "Ovis dalli"

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_SHEEPTHINHORN_TRIVIA01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Thinhorn sheep
#. trivia fact 01"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_SHEEPTHINHORN_TRIVIA01"
msgid ""
"Thinhorn sheep prefer areas with strong winds throughout the winter, as it's"
" easier to find patches of vegetation where the wind has blown the snow "
"cover away."
msgstr ""
"Ovce aljašské v zimě vyhledávají větrná místa, kde vítr odfoukává sníh a "
"odkrývá vegetaci."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_SHEEPTHINHORN_TRIVIA02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Thinhorn sheep
#. trivia fact 02"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_SHEEPTHINHORN_TRIVIA02"
msgid ""
"As the horns of the Thinhorn sheep grow, bumpy rings form annually around "
"their circumference, and the sheep's age may be determined by the number of "
"rings."
msgstr ""
"Na rozích ovce aljašské se každoročně tvoří růstové prstence. Jejich počet "
"pomáhá určit věk zvířete."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_SHEEPTHINHORN_TRIVIA03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Thinhorn sheep
#. trivia fact 03"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_SHEEPTHINHORN_TRIVIA03"
msgid ""
"Thinhorn sheep may form nursery groups where one or two ewes watch over the "
"lambs while the other mothers feed."
msgstr ""
"Ovce aljašské mohou tvořit skupiny, v nichž jedna nebo dvě bahnice hlídají "
"jehňata, zatímco ostatní se pasou."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_SHEEPTHINHORN_TRIVIA04
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Thinhorn sheep
#. trivia fact 04"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_SHEEPTHINHORN_TRIVIA04"
msgid ""
"Sheep will kick and slam into each other with their horns. To prevent "
"injuries to the brain, they have several \"cushions\" of air in their heads,"
" which absorb some of the impact."
msgstr ""
"Berani do sebe při soubojích narážejí rohy. Náraz pomáhají tlumit vzduchové "
"dutiny v lebce."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_TURKEYWILD_APPEARANCE_AGE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Wild turkey age
#. variation description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_TURKEYWILD_APPEARANCE_AGE"
msgid "Adults develop brighter plumage and caruncles."
msgstr "Dospělí mají výraznější opeření a masité kožní výrůstky."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_TURKEYWILD_APPEARANCE_COAT
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Wild turkey coat
#. description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_TURKEYWILD_APPEARANCE_COAT"
msgid ""
"Dark brown to black plumage with a metallic sheen, some feathers are tipped "
"with various colors"
msgstr ""
"Tmavě hnědé až černé opeření s kovovým leskem; konce některých per jsou "
"různě zbarvené"

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_TURKEYWILD_APPEARANCE_DIMENSIONS
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Wild turkey sex
#. dimensions description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_TURKEYWILD_APPEARANCE_DIMENSIONS"
msgid "Adult gobblers are twice as heavy as hens."
msgstr "Dospělí krocani bývají dvakrát těžší než krůty."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_TURKEYWILD_APPEARANCE_SEX
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Wild turkey sex
#. other parameters description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_TURKEYWILD_APPEARANCE_SEX"
msgid ""
"Gobblers have a prominent tail fan, longer tail feathers and larger head "
"caruncles. They also have brighter coloration."
msgstr ""
"Krocani mají výrazný ocasní vějíř, delší ocasní pera a větší masité výrůstky"
" na hlavě. Jsou také pestřeji zbarveni."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_TURKEYWILD_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Wild turkey
#. description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_TURKEYWILD_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"The keystone element of Thanksgiving Day dinners in the US, Wild turkeys "
"also live in Mexico and Canada. Known for their larger size, exuberant "
"wattles and fan-shaped tail sported by males, turkeys are challenging "
"hunting targets that have been taunting the very best of North American "
"hunters for centuries."
msgstr ""
"Krocan divoký je tradiční součástí večeře na Den díkůvzdání v USA, ale žije "
"i v Kanadě a Mexiku. Samci mají výrazné masité výrůstky a ocas roztažený do "
"vějíře. Pro severoamerické lovce představuje už po staletí náročnou kořist."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_TURKEYWILD_HUNTING_BIOMES
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Wild turkey biomes
#. description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_TURKEYWILD_HUNTING_BIOMES"
msgid "Forests with scattered openings"
msgstr "Lesy s roztroušenými světlinami"

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_TURKEYWILD_HUNTING_STRENGTHS01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Wild turkey strength
#. against hunters 01"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_TURKEYWILD_HUNTING_STRENGTHS01"
msgid "Plumage camouflage"
msgstr "Zbarvení opeření ho maskuje v terénu"

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_TURKEYWILD_HUNTING_STRENGTHS02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Wild turkey strength
#. against hunters 02"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_TURKEYWILD_HUNTING_STRENGTHS02"
msgid "Collective awareness"
msgstr "Bdělost celého hejna"

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_TURKEYWILD_HUNTING_STRENGTHS03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Wild turkey strength
#. against hunters 03"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_TURKEYWILD_HUNTING_STRENGTHS03"
msgid "Often flies to escape danger"
msgstr "Před nebezpečím často odlétá"

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_TURKEYWILD_HUNTING_WEAKNESSES01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Wild turkey weakness
#. against hunters 01"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_TURKEYWILD_HUNTING_WEAKNESSES01"
msgid "Highly curious"
msgstr "Velmi zvědavý"

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_TURKEYWILD_HUNTING_WEAKNESSES02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Wild turkey weakness
#. against hunters 02"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_TURKEYWILD_HUNTING_WEAKNESSES02"
msgid "Responsive to calling"
msgstr "Reaguje na vábení"

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_TURKEYWILD_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "animal species Wild turkey name"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "DayOnePatch"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_TURKEYWILD_NAME"
msgid "Wild turkey"
msgstr "Krocan divoký"

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_TURKEYWILD_NAME_LATIN
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:	"MetaData.Gather" : "False"
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Wild turkey name,
#. Latin"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "DayOnePatch"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_TURKEYWILD_NAME_LATIN"
msgid "Meleagris gallopavo"
msgstr "Meleagris gallopavo"

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_TURKEYWILD_TRIVIA01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Wild turkey trivia
#. fact 01"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_TURKEYWILD_TRIVIA01"
msgid ""
"The long fleshy object that hangs over a male Turkey's beak is called a "
"snood."
msgstr ""
"Dlouhý masitý výrůstek, který krocanům visí nad zobákem, se anglicky nazývá "
"snood."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_TURKEYWILD_TRIVIA02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Wild turkey trivia
#. fact 02"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_TURKEYWILD_TRIVIA02"
msgid "Despite their weight, wild turkeys are agile, fast fliers."
msgstr "Krocani divocí jsou navzdory své hmotnosti obratní a rychlí letci."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_TURKEYWILD_TRIVIA03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Wild turkey trivia
#. fact 03"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_TURKEYWILD_TRIVIA03"
msgid ""
"Male Wild turkeys occasionally attack reflective surfaces, thinking they see"
" another turkey and must defend their territory."
msgstr ""
"Samci krocanů divokých někdy útočí na lesklé plochy. Svůj odraz považují za "
"cizího krocana, před kterým brání území."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_WARTHOG_APPEARANCE_AGE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Warthog age
#. variation description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_WARTHOG_APPEARANCE_AGE"
msgid "Adults develop coarser hair."
msgstr "Dospělým rostou hrubší štětiny."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_WARTHOG_APPEARANCE_COAT
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Warthog coat
#. description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_WARTHOG_APPEARANCE_COAT"
msgid "Grayish-brown to dark brown"
msgstr "Šedohnědá až tmavě hnědá"

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_WARTHOG_APPEARANCE_DIMENSIONS
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Warthog sex
#. dimensions description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_WARTHOG_APPEARANCE_DIMENSIONS"
msgid ""
"Males are heavier. They have larger tusks and warts (thickened pads of "
"tissue on their faces)."
msgstr ""
"Samci jsou těžší, mají větší kly a výraznější kožní výrůstky na hlavě."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_WARTHOG_APPEARANCE_SEX
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Warthog sex other
#. parameters description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_WARTHOG_APPEARANCE_SEX"
msgid "The main difference between males and females is in size."
msgstr "Hlavní rozdíl mezi samci a samicemi je ve velikosti."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_WARTHOG_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "animal species Warthog description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_WARTHOG_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"This opportunistic African hog is the only species that has successfully "
"learned to graze in savanna habitats. Pigs are impressively adaptable."
msgstr ""
"Prase bradavičnaté je přizpůsobivý africký druh, který se na savaně živí "
"také spásáním trávy."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_WARTHOG_HUNTING_BIOMES
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Warthog biomes
#. description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_WARTHOG_HUNTING_BIOMES"
msgid ""
"Open savannas and semi-deserts, avoiding rainforests and severe deserts"
msgstr ""
"Otevřené savany a polopouště; deštným pralesům a vyprahlým pouštím se vyhýbá"

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_WARTHOG_HUNTING_STRENGTHS01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Warthog strength
#. against hunters 01"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_WARTHOG_HUNTING_STRENGTHS01"
msgid "Thick skin"
msgstr "Silná kůže"

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_WARTHOG_HUNTING_STRENGTHS02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Warthog strength
#. against hunters 02"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_WARTHOG_HUNTING_STRENGTHS02"
msgid "Quick reflexes and high speed"
msgstr "Rychlé reflexy a vysoká rychlost"

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_WARTHOG_HUNTING_WEAKNESSES01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Warthog weakness
#. against hunters 01"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_WARTHOG_HUNTING_WEAKNESSES01"
msgid "Predictable behavior near waterholes and burrows"
msgstr "U napajedel a nor lze jeho pohyb předvídat"

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_WARTHOG_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "animal species Warthog name"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "DayOnePatch"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_WARTHOG_NAME"
msgid "Warthog"
msgstr "Prase bradavičnaté"

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_WARTHOG_NAME_ALTERNATIVE01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Warthog name,
#. alternative 01"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "DayOnePatch"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_WARTHOG_NAME_ALTERNATIVE01"
msgid "Common warthog"
msgstr "Prase bradavičnaté"

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_WARTHOG_NAME_LATIN
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:	"MetaData.Gather" : "False"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "animal species Warthog name, Latin"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "DayOnePatch"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_WARTHOG_NAME_LATIN"
msgid "Phacochoerus africanus"
msgstr "Phacochoerus africanus"

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_WARTHOG_TRIVIA01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Warthog trivia fact
#. 01"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_WARTHOG_TRIVIA01"
msgid "Common warthog ivory comes from their constantly growing canine teeth."
msgstr ""
"Kly prasete bradavičnatého jsou stále rostoucí špičáky. Z nich pochází i "
"jeho slonovina."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_WILDEBEEST_APPEARANCE_AGE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Wildebeest age
#. variation description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_WILDEBEEST_APPEARANCE_AGE"
msgid "Adults have generally darker coats with more pronounced stripes."
msgstr "Dospělí jedinci mají obecně tmavší srst s výraznějšími pruhy."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_WILDEBEEST_APPEARANCE_COAT
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Wildebeest coat
#. description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_WILDEBEEST_APPEARANCE_COAT"
msgid "Blue-gray or dark brown-to-black"
msgstr "Modrošedá nebo tmavě hnědá až černá"

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_WILDEBEEST_APPEARANCE_DIMENSIONS
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Wildebeest sex
#. dimensions description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_WILDEBEEST_APPEARANCE_DIMENSIONS"
msgid "Males are larger and have thicker horns."
msgstr "Samci jsou větší a mají silnější rohy."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_WILDEBEEST_APPEARANCE_SEX
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Wildebeest sex other
#. parameters description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_WILDEBEEST_APPEARANCE_SEX"
msgid ""
"No significant differences between males and females other than in their "
"sizes and colorations."
msgstr "Kromě velikosti a zbarvení se samci a samice výrazně neliší."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_WILDEBEEST_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Wildebeest
#. description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_WILDEBEEST_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Abundant antelopes of larger sizes, native to eastern and southern Africa. "
"Wildebeest are known for their iconic facial shape. They simply cannot "
"survive without a plentiful water source nearby."
msgstr ""
"Pakůň je velká a hojná antilopa východní a jižní Afriky. Pozná se podle "
"výrazného tvaru hlavy a potřebuje mít v dosahu vydatný zdroj vody."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_WILDEBEEST_HUNTING_BIOMES
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Wildebeest biomes
#. description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_WILDEBEEST_HUNTING_BIOMES"
msgid ""
"Savannas and open woodlands with rapidly regrowing grasses and moderate "
"moisture"
msgstr "Savany a řídké lesy s rychle dorůstající trávou a přiměřenou vlhkostí"

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_WILDEBEEST_HUNTING_STRENGTHS01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Wildebeest strength
#. against hunters 01"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_WILDEBEEST_HUNTING_STRENGTHS01"
msgid "Powerful frame"
msgstr "Mohutná tělesná stavba"

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_WILDEBEEST_HUNTING_WEAKNESSES01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Wildebeest weakness
#. against hunters 01"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_WILDEBEEST_HUNTING_WEAKNESSES01"
msgid "Restricted mobility"
msgstr "Omezená pohyblivost"

