#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_WOLFGRAY_TRIVIA01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Gray wolf trivia
#. fact 01"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_WOLFGRAY_TRIVIA01"
msgid ""
"Gray wolves are fast animals, reaching a speed of about 37 mph (60 km/h)."
msgstr "Vlk obecný dosahuje rychlosti přibližně 60 kilometrů za hodinu."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_WOLFGRAY_TRIVIA02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Gray wolf trivia
#. fact 02"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_WOLFGRAY_TRIVIA02"
msgid ""
"Gray wolves feed their pups by regurgitation: they chew and ingest food, "
"then vomit it up to feed to their puppies."
msgstr ""
"Vlci krmí mláďata vyvrženou potravou. Dospělý vlk potravu pozře a později ji"
" mláďatům vyvrhne."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_WOLFGRAY_TRIVIA03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Gray wolf trivia
#. fact 03"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_WOLFGRAY_TRIVIA03"
msgid ""
"Gray wolves show deep affection for one another, and are known to sacrifice "
"themselves when necessary to protect family members."
msgstr ""
"Vlci mezi sebou vytvářejí silná pouta a při ochraně členů smečky mohou "
"riskovat vlastní život."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_WOLFGRAY_TRIVIA04
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Gray wolf trivia
#. fact 04"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_WOLFGRAY_TRIVIA04"
msgid ""
"Like human fingerprints, the howl of each Wolf is unique, allowing pack "
"members, as well as researchers, to identify an individual."
msgstr ""
"Vytí každého vlka má charakteristický zvuk. Členové smečky i výzkumníci tak "
"mohou rozpoznat jednotlivce."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_WOLFGRAY_TRIVIA05
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Gray wolf trivia
#. fact 05"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_WOLFGRAY_TRIVIA05"
msgid ""
"A lone wolf is a wolf that has been expelled from the pack or has left the "
"pack of its own free will."
msgstr "Osamělý vlk byl buď ze smečky vypuzen, nebo ji sám opustil."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_WOLVERINE_APPEARANCE_AGE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Wolverine age
#. variation description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_WOLVERINE_APPEARANCE_AGE"
msgid "Adults are more territorial and solitary."
msgstr "Dospělí jedinci si více hájí území a častěji žijí samotářsky."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_WOLVERINE_APPEARANCE_COAT
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Wolverine coat
#. description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_WOLVERINE_APPEARANCE_COAT"
msgid "Dark brown with lighter patches across the body"
msgstr "Tmavě hnědá se světlejšími skvrnami po celém těle"

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_WOLVERINE_APPEARANCE_DIMENSIONS
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Wolverine sex
#. dimensions description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_WOLVERINE_APPEARANCE_DIMENSIONS"
msgid "Males are a third to a half larger and heavier than females."
msgstr "Samci jsou o třetinu až polovinu větší a těžší než samice."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_WOLVERINE_APPEARANCE_SEX
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Wolverine sex other
#. parameters description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_WOLVERINE_APPEARANCE_SEX"
msgid "Males are significantly more aggressive."
msgstr "Samci jsou výrazně agresivnější."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_WOLVERINE_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "animal species Wolverine description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_WOLVERINE_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"The largest land-dwelling mustelid, the wolverine is the closest the "
"Northern Hemisphere has to replicating the ferocity of the honey badger, "
"reportedly being capable of subduing prey several times larger than itself."
msgstr ""
"Rosomák severní je největší suchozemská lasicovitá šelma. Svou houževnatostí"
" připomíná medojeda kapského a podle některých zpráv dokáže přemoci kořist "
"několikanásobně větší, než je sám."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_WOLVERINE_HUNTING_BIOMES
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Wolverine biomes
#. description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_WOLVERINE_HUNTING_BIOMES"
msgid "Alpine forests, tundra, open grasslands at or above timberline"
msgstr ""
"Horské lesy, tundra a otevřené travnaté oblasti u horní hranice lesa či nad "
"ní"

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_WOLVERINE_HUNTING_STRENGTHS01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Wolverine strength
#. against hunters 01"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_WOLVERINE_HUNTING_STRENGTHS01"
msgid "Inhabits difficult terrain"
msgstr "Obývá obtížně přístupný terén"

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_WOLVERINE_HUNTING_WEAKNESSES01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Wolverine weakness
