#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_WOLVERINE_TRIVIA01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Wolverine trivia
#. fact 01"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_WOLVERINE_TRIVIA01"
msgid "Wolverines can kill prey many times larger than themselves."
msgstr "Rosomák severní dokáže ulovit kořist mnohonásobně větší, než je sám."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_WOLVERINE_TRIVIA02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Wolverine trivia
#. fact 02"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_WOLVERINE_TRIVIA02"
msgid ""
"Wolverines have thick, dark, oily, highly hydrophobic fur, making it "
"resistant to frost."
msgstr ""
"Rosomák má hustou, tmavou a mastnou srst, která odpuzuje vodu a odolává "
"namrzání."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_WOLVERINE_TRIVIA03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Wolverine trivia
#. fact 03"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_WOLVERINE_TRIVIA03"
msgid ""
"Wolverines eat bones, crushing them with their powerful teeth and jaws."
msgstr "Rosomák dokáže silnými zuby a čelistmi drtit kosti a živit se jimi."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_WOLVERINE_TRIVIA04
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Wolverine trivia
#. fact 04"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_WOLVERINE_TRIVIA04"
msgid ""
"As a Wolverine walks, its paws spread out to almost twice their size at "
"rest, making it easier to walk on snow."
msgstr ""
"Rosomákovi se při chůzi tlapy roztáhnou téměř na dvojnásobek klidové šířky. "
"Díky tomu se snáze pohybuje po sněhu."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_WOLVERINE_TRIVIA05
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Wolverine trivia
#. fact 05"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_WOLVERINE_TRIVIA05"
msgid ""
"Wolverines have a special kind of upper molar, which is rotated 90 degrees, "
"allowing it to tear flesh apart more efficiently."
msgstr ""
"Rosomák má zvláštní horní stoličku pootočenou o 90 stupňů, díky níž může "
"účinněji trhat maso."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_ZEBRA_APPEARANCE_AGE
