#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_ZEBRA_APPEARANCE_COAT"
msgid "Black and white stripes"
msgstr "Černé a bílé pruhy"

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_ZEBRA_APPEARANCE_DIMENSIONS
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Zebra sex dimensions
#. description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_ZEBRA_APPEARANCE_DIMENSIONS"
msgid ""
"Differences in sizes are inconsistent. Females can be larger than males, and"
" vice versa."
msgstr ""
"Velikostní rozdíly nejsou stálé: někdy jsou větší samice, jindy samci."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_ZEBRA_APPEARANCE_SEX
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal species Zebra sex other
#. parameters description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_ZEBRA_APPEARANCE_SEX"
msgid "Stallions have a more prominent dewlap (loose skin under neck)."
msgstr "Hřebci mají výraznější kožní lalok pod krkem."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_ZEBRA_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "animal species Zebra description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_ZEBRA_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"The zebra is a wild African equine, famous for its striped monochrome coat. "
"The exact pattern is unique to each individual."
msgstr ""
"Zebra je africký koňovitý savec s typickým černobílým pruhováním. Kresba "
"pruhů je u každého jedince jedinečná."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_ZEBRA_HUNTING_BIOMES
