msgid "Hippotigris"
msgstr "Hippotigris"

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_ZEBRA_TRIVIA01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "animal species Zebra trivia fact 01"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_ZEBRA_TRIVIA01"
msgid "Zebras are thought to be able to see colors."
msgstr "Předpokládá se, že zebry rozlišují barvy."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_ZEBRA_TRIVIA02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "animal species Zebra trivia fact 02"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_ZEBRA_TRIVIA02"
msgid "Zebras see well both during the day and at night."
msgstr "Zebry dobře vidí ve dne i v noci."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_ZEBRA_TRIVIA03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "animal species Zebra trivia fact 03"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_ZEBRA_TRIVIA03"
msgid "Zebras possess binocular vision in the front."
msgstr ""
"Zebry mají před hlavou oblast prostorového vidění, v níž se zorná pole obou "
"očí překrývají."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_ZEBRA_TRIVIA04
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "animal species Zebra trivia fact 04"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_ZEBRA_TRIVIA04"
msgid ""
"The striped color patterns of Zebras are likely to reflect over 70% of "
"incoming heat."
msgstr ""
"Zebřím pruhům se dříve připisoval ochlazovací účinek, pokusy jej však "
"nepotvrdily."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_ZEBRA_TRIVIA05
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "animal species Zebra trivia fact 05"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SPECIES_ZEBRA_TRIVIA05"
msgid ""
"Zebras have developed this type of coloration to get rid of biting insects, "
"whose visual systems don't perceive a monochrome pattern."
msgstr ""
"Pruhování zebry omezuje dosedání bodavého hmyzu. Přesný mechanismus tohoto "
"účinku se stále zkoumá."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SUBSPECIES_AEPYCEROSMELAMPUSMELAMPUS_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal subspecies Common impala
