#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SUBSPECIES_AFROTISAFRAOIDES_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal subspecies Northern black
#. korhaan description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SUBSPECIES_AFROTISAFRAOIDES_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"An exotic subspecies known for its black-and-white patterned markings. Not "
"normally a target for hunters, so enjoy the opportunity!"
msgstr ""
"Exotický drop s výraznou černobílou kresbou opeření. Obvykle se neloví, "
"proto této příležitosti využijte."

