#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SUBSPECIES_ALCESALCESANDERSONI_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal subspecies Western moose
#. description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SUBSPECIES_ALCESALCESANDERSONI_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"The second largest subspecies of moose, it inhabits the Canadian western "
"provinces and sub-Arctic regions, as well as some of the northern states of "
"the USA."
msgstr ""
"Druhý největší poddruh losa obývá západní provincie Kanady, subarktické "
"oblasti a některé severní státy USA."

