#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SUBSPECIES_ALCESALCESANDERSONI_TRIVIA01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal subspecies Western moose
#. trivia fact 01\nchanged during localization"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SUBSPECIES_ALCESALCESANDERSONI_TRIVIA01"
msgid ""
"The Western moose is the second largest North American subspecies of moose, "
"second to the Alaska moose."
msgstr ""
"Los yukonský je po losu aljašském druhým největším severoamerickým poddruhem"
" losa."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SUBSPECIES_ALCESALCESGIGAS_NAME
