msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SUBSPECIES_ANTILOCAPRAAMERICANA_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"This Pronghorn subspecies inhabits the foothills of the Rocky Mountains, "
"which they find challenging because of their general dislike of rugged "
"environments."
