msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SUBSPECIES_CROCUTACROCUTA_NAME_LATIN"
msgid "Crocuta crocuta"
msgstr "Crocuta crocuta"

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SUBSPECIES_CROCUTACROCUTA_TRIVIA01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal subspecies Spotted hyena
#. trivia fact 01"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SUBSPECIES_CROCUTACROCUTA_TRIVIA01"
msgid ""
"The spotted hyena has a reputation for being cowardly and sly, but it is "
"actually a fascinating and intelligent creature with an intriguing social "
"system."
msgstr ""
"Hyena skvrnitá bývá označována za zbabělou a prohnanou. Ve skutečnosti jde o"
" inteligentní zvíře se složitým společenským životem."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SUBSPECIES_CROCUTACROCUTA_TRIVIA02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal subspecies Spotted hyena
#. trivia fact 02"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SUBSPECIES_CROCUTACROCUTA_TRIVIA02"
msgid ""
"The spotted hyena's genus name, \"crocuta\", derives from the ancient Greek "
"\"crocotta\", a mythical Ethiopian dog-wolf."
msgstr ""
"Rodové jméno hyeny skvrnité, Crocuta, pochází ze starořeckého označení "
"crocotta pro bájného etiopského psovlka."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SUBSPECIES_CROCUTACROCUTA_TRIVIA03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal subspecies Spotted hyena
#. trivia fact 03"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SUBSPECIES_CROCUTACROCUTA_TRIVIA03"
msgid ""
"Spotted hyenas can trot for long distances at 6 miles (10 kilometers) an "
"hour without getting tired. They're good swimmers as well."
msgstr ""
"Hyena skvrnitá vydrží dlouho klusat rychlostí kolem deseti kilometrů za "
"hodinu. Je také zdatným plavcem."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SUBSPECIES_DAMALISCUSPYGARGUSPHILLIPSI_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal subspecies Blesbok
#. description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt ""
"ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SUBSPECIES_DAMALISCUSPYGARGUSPHILLIPSI_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"The blesbok is a bontebok subspecies from South Africa, Namibia and "
"Eswatini. Unlike the other subspecies, it just can't imagine roaming outside"
" of open grasslands without ready access to water."
msgstr ""
"Buvolec běločelý je poddruhem buvolce pestrého. Žije v Jihoafrické "
"republice, Namibii a Eswatini. Dává přednost otevřeným travnatým pláním s "
"dostupnou vodou."

