msgstr "Damaliscus pygargus phillipsi"

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SUBSPECIES_DAMALISCUSPYGARGUSPHILLIPSI_TRIVIA01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal subspecies Blesbok trivia
#. fact 01"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt ""
"ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SUBSPECIES_DAMALISCUSPYGARGUSPHILLIPSI_TRIVIA01"
msgid ""
"Originally present in large numbers, the Blesbok was nearly hunted to "
"extinction, but has been protected since the late 19th century."
msgstr ""
"Buvolec běločelý býval hojný, ale lov jej téměř vyhubil. Od konce 19. "
"století je chráněn."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SUBSPECIES_DAMALISCUSPYGARGUSPHILLIPSI_TRIVIA02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal subspecies Blesbok trivia
#. fact 02"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt ""
"ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SUBSPECIES_DAMALISCUSPYGARGUSPHILLIPSI_TRIVIA02"
msgid ""
"\"Bles\" is the Afrikaans word for \"blaze\", a reference to the blaze on "
"the blesbok's face."
msgstr ""
"Afrikánské slovo „bles“ znamená lysinu a odkazuje na bílou kresbu na hlavě "
"buvolce běločelého."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SUBSPECIES_EQUUSZEBRAZEBRA_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
