#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SUBSPECIES_LAGOPUSLEUCURA_TRIVIA01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal subspecies White-tailed
#. ptarmigan trivia fact 01"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SUBSPECIES_LAGOPUSLEUCURA_TRIVIA01"
msgid ""
"The White-tailed ptarmigan has feathers on its feet to serve as protection "
"from the extreme cold often experienced in the alpine tundra environment."
msgstr ""
"Bělokur běloocasý má opeřené nohy, které ho chrání před silným chladem "
"horské tundry."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SUBSPECIES_LAGOPUSLEUCURA_TRIVIA02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal subspecies White-tailed
#. ptarmigan trivia fact 02"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SUBSPECIES_LAGOPUSLEUCURA_TRIVIA02"
msgid ""
"The White-tailed ptarmigan has feathers around its nostrils to warm the air "
"prior to entry into the respiratory tract."
msgstr ""
"Bělokur běloocasý má peří i kolem nozder. Vdechovaný vzduch se díky němu "
"ohřívá dříve, než pronikne do dýchacích cest."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SUBSPECIES_LAGOPUSLEUCURA_TRIVIA03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal subspecies White-tailed
#. ptarmigan trivia fact 03"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SUBSPECIES_LAGOPUSLEUCURA_TRIVIA03"
msgid ""
"To conserve energy during the winter months, the White-tailed ptarmigan "
"avoids flight as much as possible and roosts in snowbanks."
msgstr ""
"Bělokur běloocasý v zimě šetří energii: létá co nejméně a nocuje v závějích."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SUBSPECIES_LAGOPUSLEUCURA_TRIVIA04
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal subspecies White-tailed
#. ptarmigan trivia fact 04"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SUBSPECIES_LAGOPUSLEUCURA_TRIVIA04"
msgid ""
"The White-tailed ptarmigan is the smallest of the ptarmigans and the "
"smallest bird in the grouse family."
msgstr ""
"Bělokur běloocasý je nejmenší ze všech bělokurů a zároveň nejmenší z "
"tetřevovitých ptáků."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SUBSPECIES_LEPUSAMERICANUSAMERICANUS_DESCRIPTION
