#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SUBSPECIES_OVISDALLIDALLI_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal subspecies Dall sheep
#. description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SUBSPECIES_OVISDALLIDALLI_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"The northern subspecies of Thinhorn sheep that is on average less likely to "
"be light-gray or cream-colored."
msgstr ""
"Severní poddruh ovce aljašské bývá zpravidla čistěji bílý a méně často "
"světle šedý či krémový."

