msgstr "Ovis dalli dalli"

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SUBSPECIES_OVISDALLIDALLI_TRIVIA01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal subspecies Dall sheep trivia
#. fact 01"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SUBSPECIES_OVISDALLIDALLI_TRIVIA01"
msgid ""
"The Dall sheep is named after William Healey Dall. He was a scientist who "
"led surveys researching sheep in Alaska in the late 1800s."
msgstr ""
"Anglický název ovce aljašské připomíná Williama Healeyho Dalla. Tento vědec "
"koncem 19. století vedl výzkum ovcí na Aljašce."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SUBSPECIES_OVISDALLIDALLI_TRIVIA02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal subspecies Dall sheep trivia
#. fact 02"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SUBSPECIES_OVISDALLIDALLI_TRIVIA02"
msgid ""
"Dall sheep are covered in a woolly white coat that offers protection against"
" low temperatures."
msgstr "Ovce aljašské chrání před nízkými teplotami hustá bílá vlna."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SUBSPECIES_PANTHERALEOMELANOCHAITA_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal subspecies Southern lion
#. description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt ""
"ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SUBSPECIES_PANTHERALEOMELANOCHAITA_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"This subspecies covers Lions from eastern and southern Africa. It used to "
"include the now extinct Cape lion, which sported an impressive black mane."
msgstr ""
"Tento poddruh zahrnuje lvy východní a jižní Afriky. Dříve se k němu řadil i "
"vyhynulý lev kapský s nápadnou černou hřívou."

