#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SUBSPECIES_TRAGELAPHUSSTREPSICEROSSTREPSICEROS_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
