msgstr "Tragelaphus strepsiceros strepsiceros"

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SUBSPECIES_TRAGELAPHUSSTREPSICEROSSTREPSICEROS_TRIVIA01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal subspecies Greater kudu
#. trivia fact 01"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt ""
"ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SUBSPECIES_TRAGELAPHUSSTREPSICEROSSTREPSICEROS_TRIVIA01"
msgid "The Greater kudu is the second-largest antelope species in the world."
msgstr "Kudu velký je druhou největší antilopou na světě."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SUBSPECIES_TRAGELAPHUSSTREPSICEROSSTREPSICEROS_TRIVIA02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal subspecies Greater kudu
#. trivia fact 02"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt ""
"ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SUBSPECIES_TRAGELAPHUSSTREPSICEROSSTREPSICEROS_TRIVIA02"
msgid ""
"You can tell the age of the Greater kudu by the number of twists on its "
"horns."
msgstr "Věk kudu velkého lze odhadnout podle počtu závitů jeho rohů."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SUBSPECIES_TRAGELAPHUSSTREPSICEROSSTREPSICEROS_TRIVIA03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal subspecies Greater kudu
#. trivia fact 03"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt ""
"ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SUBSPECIES_TRAGELAPHUSSTREPSICEROSSTREPSICEROS_TRIVIA03"
msgid ""
"Despite being very nimble over rocky hillsides and mountains, Greater kudus "
"are not fast enough to escape their main predators over open terrain, where "
"they usually rely on leaping over shrubs and small trees to shake off "
"pursuers."
msgstr ""
"Kudu velcí se obratně pohybují po skalnatých svazích, ale na otevřené pláni "
"predátorům rychlostí nestačí. Při útěku proto přeskakují keře a nízké "
"stromy."

#. Key:	KEY_ANIMALS_SUBSPECIES_URSUSARCTOSHORRIBILIS_DESCRIPTION
