#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "animal subspecies Grizzly bear
#. description"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/Animals/_Shared/ST_Animals.ST_Animals
msgctxt "ST_Animals,KEY_ANIMALS_SUBSPECIES_URSUSARCTOSHORRIBILIS_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Grizzly bears are North American brown bears. Populations are spread over "
"western Canada, the USA and north Mexico."
msgstr ""
"Medvěd grizzly je severoamerický poddruh medvěda hnědého. Žije v západní "
"Kanadě, USA a severním Mexiku."

